{"meta":{"title":"單字特訓","unitWord":"Unit","sample":true,"note":"這是示範用的單字,請換成教材的正式內容","words":32,"units":[1,2,3],"banks":[{"id":"b1","name":"單字庫 A(示範)"},{"id":"b2","name":"單字庫 B(示範)"}]},"words":[{"id":"b1-abandon","bank":"b1","w":"abandon","pos":"v.","zh":"放棄;遺棄","unit":1,"ex":"He abandoned the plan.","exzh":"他放棄了那個計畫。"},{"id":"b1-ability","bank":"b1","w":"ability","pos":"n.","zh":"能力","unit":1,"ex":"She has the ability to learn fast.","exzh":"她有很快學會的能力。"},{"id":"b1-accept","bank":"b1","w":"accept","pos":"v.","zh":"接受","unit":1,"ex":"Please accept my gift.","exzh":"請收下我的禮物。"},{"id":"b1-achieve","bank":"b1","w":"achieve","pos":"v.","zh":"達成;完成","unit":1,"ex":"You can achieve your goal.","exzh":"你能達成你的目標。"},{"id":"b1-active","bank":"b1","w":"active","pos":"adj.","zh":"活躍的;積極的","unit":1,"ex":"He is an active member of the club.","exzh":"他是社團的活躍成員。"},{"id":"b1-adopt","bank":"b1","w":"adopt","pos":"v.","zh":"領養;採用","unit":1,"ex":"They adopted a puppy.","exzh":"他們領養了一隻小狗。"},{"id":"b1-advice","bank":"b1","w":"advice","pos":"n.","zh":"建議","unit":1,"ex":"Take my advice.","exzh":"聽我的建議。"},{"id":"b1-afford","bank":"b1","w":"afford","pos":"v.","zh":"負擔得起","unit":1,"ex":"I can't afford a new phone.","exzh":"我買不起新手機。"},{"id":"b1-agree","bank":"b1","w":"agree","pos":"v.","zh":"同意","unit":2,"ex":"I agree with you.","exzh":"我同意你。"},{"id":"b1-allow","bank":"b1","w":"allow","pos":"v.","zh":"允許","unit":2,"ex":"Smoking is not allowed here.","exzh":"這裡不准吸菸。"},{"id":"b1-amazing","bank":"b1","w":"amazing","pos":"adj.","zh":"令人驚奇的","unit":2,"ex":"The view is amazing.","exzh":"風景令人驚嘆。"},{"id":"b1-ancient","bank":"b1","w":"ancient","pos":"adj.","zh":"古代的","unit":2,"ex":"They visited an ancient temple.","exzh":"他們參觀了一座古老的廟。"},{"id":"b1-announce","bank":"b1","w":"announce","pos":"v.","zh":"宣布","unit":2,"ex":"The school announced the news.","exzh":"學校宣布了這個消息。"},{"id":"b1-anxious","bank":"b1","w":"anxious","pos":"adj.","zh":"焦慮的;渴望的","unit":2,"ex":"She felt anxious before the test.","exzh":"考試前她感到